  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aleanca LGBTI&apos;s: Solidarity in Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&apos;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&quot; the partner organisation Aleanca is implementing a 9-month project &quot;Solidarity in Action&quot;. The overarching goal of this project is to empower and strengthen the organizational capacities of Aleanca LGBTI, foster alliances with women organizations, state institutions, and media, and resist the Anti-LGBTI and Anti-democratic movements in Albania.</narrative>
  </description>
